{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1150732-how-do-new-atavisms-morph-a-horror","id":1150732,"title":"How do new Atavisms Morph a horror?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Beast: The Primordial"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-10-18T12:40:35-07:00","id":1150732,"title":"How do new Atavisms Morph a horror?","content":"Was thinking,ideas how learning a new Atavism could shift a horror, as Alien Allure, and a Dragon, griffin, Cyclops, Kraken, Illiithid, Leprachaun, Seem rather odd together<br /> <br /> Many others the mythology can adapt fairly naturally, by them growing wings or such.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-18T12:49:27-07:00","id":1150739,"title":"","content":"Don't forget the physical features of the Horror and its Lair are entirely based on the dream-logic of the Primordial Dream, and so are extremely flexible and malleable. Not to mention many mythic monster archetypes that Horrors may be based upon include a broad range of features and supernatural powers that can justify most Atavisms. I started a discussion myself on this point <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1032892-horrors-with-many-atavisms\">here</a>.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1949,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1949-irioth","user":"Irioth","date":". 10-18-2017, 06:40 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1949-irioth","name":"Irioth","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"566"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-18T22:50:38-07:00","id":1150901,"title":"","content":"For my mad doctor namtaru i flavor some of his atavisms as being derived from his Lair or just have its appearance evolve each time it gains a new atavism. For example, he started with Basilisk's Touch, Shadowed Soul and Mimir's Wisdom. Basilisk's Touch is represented by the horror's toxic blood - it has taken as much of its own medicine as it has administered and now the deadly stuff seeps from its needle-tipped fingers. For Shadowed Soul, the Beast draws on its asylum lair with its dim, flickering lights and twisting halls, where it can appear out of the darkness any time from a hidden passage or dark corner and seems to see everything that happens. Mimir's Wisdom was the easiest and it is his signature atavism - he has ripped countless secrets from the minds of patients and being an unhinged psychiatrist it can sense when you are telling lies. <br /> <br /> later on my Beast learned Unbreakable and Infestation. Unbreakable was also easy - the Horror simply shrugs off injury and seems to have an almost cartoonish physiology that warps and deforms as if it were in a dream, and Infestation actually changes the Beast into a collection of small plastic toys, this Atavism being one my Beast learned from spending time with his daughter in her own section of their brood lair and playing with her and her broken toys.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/11.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/16101-eternal-darkness","name":"Eternal Darkness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar16101_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"95"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-21T17:51:25-07:00","id":1151799,"title":"","content":"I figure they can make it look like whatever you want. My Ugallu Ravager that I've been playing for a while is a street artist vagrant, with a dragon/wyvern Horror. I describe it as looking like &quot;movie Smaug.&quot;<br /> <br /> He started out with Wings of the Raptor and Dragonfire, both very obvious choices. Later on, he learned Unbreakable, which got him harder, almost metallic scales, Eye of Heaven, which didn't really cause any physical changes, just sharper senses, and most recently, From the Shadows, which gave it chameleon-esque skin.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1419-wardragon","name":"WarDragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1419_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1052"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}